"{\n \"url\": \"https://vine-mandevilla-7ed.notion.site/Level-Design-Breakdown-3b37216d8bc580d7a243d1c682702c55\",\n \"text\": \"Skip to content\\nPray For Plagues, Souls-borne Prototype\\n/\\nSystems Documentation\\n/\\nLevel Design Breakdown\\nGet Notion free\\nLevel Design Breakdown\\n4 more properties\\nOverview\\nThe level design is structured around a multi‑layered dungeon complex that emphasizes exploration, spatial mastery, and deliberate encounter pacing. The dungeon consists of three floors, each introducing new enemy types, environmental challenges, and traversal opportunities. The top floor houses two boss arenas, while a massive sealed gate leads players downward to the final boss chamber located on the ground floor, creating a clear sense of progression and escalating tension.\\nDisclaimer: The level is not fully complete, the final boss section will be made later down the line.\\nPrison Section\\nThe dungeon connects seamlessly to an adjacent prison section, which serves as an early‑game area and a natural extension of the dungeon’s narrative and spatial flow.\\nDungeon Section\\nInspired by classic Dark Souls design principles, the dungeon incorporates looping pathways and unlock-able shortcuts that allow players to backtrack efficiently and create mental maps of the environment. These shortcuts reward exploration and reduce friction during repeated traversal, especially after boss defeats or difficult encounters.\\nThe level itself is heavily inspired by bloodborne’s Victorian era theme and Devil May Cry’s gothic environment giving players an eerie and chilling experience, where nowhere is safe as death lurks in the shadows.\\nFirst Floor\\nFirst Dungeon Entrance\\nMain Hall\\nThe Idol Of Death (Upgrade Statue)\\nTunnel Variant 1\\nSecond Dungeon Entrance\\nSecond Floor\\nSecond Floor Entrance\\nBalcony (Left Wing)\\nThird Floor\\nBridge Connecting To The Right Wing\\nPrayer Room\\n2 Quarter Chamber Entrance\\nOverall, the dungeons design combines vertical progression, interconnected pathways, environmental storytelling, and strategic encounter placement to deliver a cohesive, challenging, and exploration‑driven experience that aligns with the game’s core combat philosophy.\\nShare site\\nLevel Design Breakdown\\nGet Notion free\\nLevel Design Breakdown\\nOverview\\nPrison Section\\nDungeon Section\\nCopy URL\\nSign up or log in\\nReport page\\nCookie settings\\nStrictly necessary\\nEssential for the site to function. Always On.\\nFunctional\\nUsed to remember preference selections and provide enhanced features.\\nAnalytics\\nUsed to measure usage and improve your experience.\\nMarketing\\nUsed for targeted advertising.\",\n \"media\": [\n  \"IMG: https://vine-mandevilla-7ed.notion.site/icons/laptop_gray.svg?mode=dark\",\n  \"IMG: https://vine-mandevilla-7ed.notion.site/image/attachment%3A2de448ec-f6c1-4edd-bb4d-f56799639d49%3AScreenshot_2026-08-06_at_00-42-35_I_havent_posted_my_art_here_in_a_while_I_made_this_artwork_a_year_back_hope_you_like_it_r_bloodborne.png?table=block&id=3b37216d-8bc5-80d7-a243-d1c682702c55&spaceId=9ee7216d-8bc5-81ea-ab4d-0003a2e97de9&width=1860&userId=&cache=v2&imgBuildSrc=requestProxiedImageUrl\",\n  \"IMG: https://vine-mandevilla-7ed.notion.site/image/attachment%3Ad7527af8-21da-4147-9081-dc7f2e6b68f5%3AScreenshot_2026-08-09_012618.png?table=block&id=3b67216d-8bc5-8056-bb77-f8a53dd64770&spaceId=9ee7216d-8bc5-81ea-ab4d-0003a2e97de9&width=1330&userId=&cache=v2&imgBuildSrc=requestProxiedImageUrl\",\n  \"IMG: https://vine-mandevilla-7ed.notion.site/image/attachment%3A14d34989-f44e-4b4b-9382-c5c31b2e489e%3AScreenShot00000.png?table=block&id=3b67216d-8bc5-8097-a054-f0b9007cd8f3&spaceId=9ee7216d-8bc5-81ea-ab4d-0003a2e97de9&width=1330&userId=&cache=v2&imgBuildSrc=requestProxiedImageUrl\",\n  \"IMG: https://vine-mandevilla-7ed.notion.site/image/attachment%3A045bbb16-d327-4bb3-831f-b1ea9d92eec5%3AScreenShot00001.png?table=block&id=3b67216d-8bc5-8012-8de4-c0622d30827f&spaceId=9ee7216d-8bc5-81ea-